1
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:12,120
Sometimes but sad, sometimes you are a little angry, sometimes you are happy-

2
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:17,560
-Int is you angry ... all emotions are totally okay to feel.

3
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:20,720
Come to school as you are.

4
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:28,480
I think that when the pondering becomes so tangible for one-

5
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:33,000
-That it takes over a little too much, so you don't get energy-

6
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:37,840
— maybe do other activities, or that you get a little powerless-

7
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,520
-Then I think it's a sign that it's time to go and talk to someone.

8
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:46,080
But again, I would really like to say: come and talk to adults.

9
00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:48,360
About big and small.

10
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:54,680
One should probably never be afraid to put words into how to feel-

11
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:59,360
-And how to do it.
Is it that ...

12
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:04,200
... that you need help.
If one is a little afraid to put word-

13
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:07,480
-and start processes, so maybe it is still a sign on-

14
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:10,480
-That you need to talk to an adult.

15
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:13,840
Then you may need support in moving on.

16
00:02:14,800 --> 00:02:17,360
An important thing to know if one comes to a curator-

17
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:21,760
-This is that we have a professional ethical duty of confidentiality.

18
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:25,840
That means what you tell me it will stay with me.

19
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:30,720
Unless you are in any kind of danger.

20
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:32,840
Then I have to take it further.
